    "text": "<p>Using the principle of conservation of angular momentum,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>gl</mi></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>mR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>gl</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p>",
